# Trivy exceptions for the backend image scan (blocking since checklist 5.5).
#
# One CVE id per line. Every entry needs a comment above it saying why the
# finding is not reachable, and a date by which it is either fixed or the
# dependency is removed. An entry with no justification is a review finding.
#
# Format:
#   # CVE-XXXX-YYYY — not reachable: <why>. Review by <date>.
#   CVE-XXXX-YYYY
#
# Deliberately empty: the image currently has no CRITICAL/HIGH fixed-version
# finding. Unfixed CVEs are excluded by `--ignore-unfixed` and reported in the
# job summary instead of being listed here.
